{"unit_id":"Heeweelee__dsh-session-plugin#card-zh","repo":"Heeweelee/dsh-session-plugin","commit":"f9b3905dcc60c8b148c1bfdc79a920df723f809d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Plugin 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话管理插件，在会话输入框和工作区会话列表中提供消息历史回填与会话操作。用户可用方向键逐条浏览已发送的文本，暂存并恢复草稿，也可打开标题栏历史面板搜索、点选回填或隐藏单条记录。插件从本地会话日志读取最近消息，并支持右键删除空闲会话。它适合希望快速复用历史提问、整理工作区会话的 DSH 用户；配置目录可通过 DSH_HOME 指定。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:240-273","dist/client.js:590-655","index.js:858-910"]}
{"unit_id":"Heeweelee__dsh-session-plugin#card-en","repo":"Heeweelee/dsh-session-plugin","commit":"f9b3905dcc60c8b148c1bfdc79a920df723f809d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Plugin adds message recall and session controls to DSH web. Use ↑/↓ to browse sent text and preserve a draft, or search the header panel and select a message. A workspace context menu offers session deletion. It reads local logs; DSH_HOME selects its configuration directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:240-273","dist/client.js:590-655","index.js:858-910"]}
