{"unit_id":"Heeweelee__dsh-session-plugin#feature-history","repo":"Heeweelee/dsh-session-plugin","commit":"f9b3905dcc60c8b148c1bfdc79a920df723f809d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Plugin 的功能「方向键回填」：聚焦输入框后按 ↑ 浏览较早的已发送消息，按 ↓ 前进；进入回填前会暂存草稿，离开历史末尾时恢复草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/client.js:428-481","dist/client.js:556-582"]}
